       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>It looks like you need to do two things:<br/>\n1. GET the memento, omitting server-manged triples<br/>\n```<br/>\ncurl -H \"Accept: text/turtle\" -H\"Prefer: return=representation; omit=\\\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#ServerManaged\\\"\" <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/version-test/fcr:versions/20180530230244\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/version-test/fcr:versions/20180530230244</a> &gt; version.ttl<br/>\n```<br/>\n2. PUT the memento over the original resource, specifying that no server-managed triples will be included<br/>\n```<br/>\ncurl -X PUT -H \"Content-Type: text/turtle\" -H \"Prefer: handling=lenient; received=\\\"minimal\\\"\" --data-binary @version.ttl  <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/version-test\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/version-test</a> -i<br/>\n```</p>",
