  "description": "<p>This task is to update the <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Backup+and+Restore\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Backup+and+Restore</a> and/or <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Import+and+Export+Tools\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Import+and+Export+Tools</a> documentation to note that the restoration of an individual resource that has associated Mementos is to:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>GET memento</li>\n\t<li>PUT over existing resource</li>\n</ul>\n",
